\lam & 1115.683 $\pm$ 0.006 & uds & \lamdecay & 7.893 $\pm$ 0.060 & 64.1 $\pm$ 0.5\% \\
\alam & 1115.683 $\pm$ 0.006 & $\bar{u}\bar{d}\bar{s}$ & \alamdecay & 7.893 $\pm$ 0.060 &  64.1 $\pm$ 0.5\%\\
\kaon & 497.648 $\pm$ 0.022 & $\frac{d\bar{s} - s \bar{d}}{\sqrt{2}}$ & \kaondecay & 2.6859 $\pm$ 0.0015 & 69.20 $\pm$ 0.05\% \\
